  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit names refinement path’s two styles: the hairy man heaven and earth style and the human isolation style. Hairy men refine Gu differently from humans; they can use the dao marks of heaven and earth to create the most conducive environment and increase the chance of succeeding. Giant Sun Immortal Venerable and Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable once sought Long Hair Ancestor’s help because that heaven and earth style had a higher Immortal Gu success rate than human isolation style.",
      "chapters": [
        1051
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_giant_sun_immortal_venerable",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable",
        "char_long_hair_ancestor",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Disregarding hairy man heaven and earth style and looking only at human isolation style, the chances of refining a rank six Immortal Gu are often less than one percent.",
      "chapters": [
        1060
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "success-rate-contrast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shadow Sect notes that Fang Yuan is using the hairy man heaven and earth style while they refuse it because heaven’s will could attack through tribulations.",
      "chapters": [
        1067
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
